{
  "slug": "hyper-marketing",
  "name": "Hyper Marketing",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect the Hyper MCP to run marketing end-to-end from Claude — Google, Meta, TikTok, Pinterest, Amazon & LinkedIn ads, organic social, SEO & AI-search research, competitor intel, ad creative, email, and analytics. 30 skills wrapping 100+ integrations and 500+ marketing tools.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **30 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (30): `ad-creative-generation` (Generate on-brand ad creatives — visuals + copy — for Google, Meta (Facebook / Instagram), and other paid…), `amazon-ads` (Plan and create Amazon Sponsored Products campaigns end-to-end via the Hyper MCP), `analytics-insights` (Drive Google Analytics (GA4), Google Tag Manager, Google Search Console, and BigQuery from chat — tracking plans, GA4…), `blog-generation` (Generate one excellent, on-brand blog post per run for any business, built to rank on Google and get…), `brand-context` (Create and maintain a single brand-context.md — positioning, audience, personas, pain points, customer language, voice, proof points —…), `cold-email-outreach` (Run end-to-end B2B cold-email outreach through the Hyper MCP — enrich prospects with Apollo, scrape per-prospect signals from…), `competitor-intel` (Run end-to-end competitor research and monitoring through the Hyper MCP — pick the set, scrape every public surface…), `customer-research` (Mine online communities and analyze existing assets to understand what customers actually think, say, and struggle with), and 22 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `hyperfx`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hyper-marketing@claude-community` from `hyperfx-ai/marketing-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 30,
    "mcp": 1
  },
